{"uid":"thag2.3","title":"Valliya (2nd)","reference":"Theragāthā 2.3","blocks":[{"kind":"verse","lines":["A monkey went up to the little hut","with five doors.","He circles around, knocking","on each door, again and again.","Stand still monkey, don’t run!","Things are different now;","you’ve been caught by wisdom—","you won’t go far."]}]}
